        "original_id": "81848e09-1015-571d-9950-ceeeb49a3696",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lukas Rossi, Terry Kath, Ben Moody, Miles McPherson, Josh Newell, Peter Cetera\n- Bands and Projects: Rock Star Supernova, Chicago, The Halo Method, We Are the Fallen, Evanescence, Daylight Division, In This Moment\n- Works and Media: Rock Star, Brand New Love Affair\n\nFacts:\n- Lukas Rossi was born on December 21, 1976, and he is a Canadian rock musician.\n- Terry Alan Kath was born on January 31, 1946, and he died on January 23, 1978.\n- Terry Kath was an American musician and songwriter best known as the original guitarist, a lead singer, and a founding member of the rock band Chicago.\n- Lukas Rossi won the CBS television reality series Rock Star, a televised audition contest to become the lead singer of the hard rock supergroup Rock Star Supernova.\n- The Halo Method consisted of guitarist Ben Moody of We Are the Fallen and formerly Evanescence, drummer Miles McPherson, vocalist Lukas Rossi formerly of Rock Star Supernova and Daylight Division, and bassist Josh Newell formerly of In This Moment.\n- In the song Brand New Love Affair, guitarist Terry Kath sings the first half and bassist Peter Cetera sings the second half.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
